<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><h2>What this review is based on</h2></div><div class="card"><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px">Same-day saved workouts, daily step totals, food logs and add-ons, supplement entries, water, and recovery check-ins. Goals and relevant prior trends inform the recommendations when available.</p><p class="note">No historical trend is claimed in this sample. Steps and water use their daily source totals, not a sum of repeated check-in snapshots. Missing meals and missing nutrient composition reduce confidence.</p></div></section>
